pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$background"
elements:
  - elementId: deco-line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [80, 58, 4, 36]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: page-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [96, 50, 1100, 48]
    content:
      style: "$heading"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>三大行业痛点：制约增材制造规模化应用的结构性瓶颈</p>
  - elementId: card1-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [80, 130, 360, 490]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$card"
  - elementId: card1-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [100, 150, 60, 40]
    content:
      fontSize: 28
      color: "$primary"
      fontFamily: "Liter"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>01</p>
  - elementId: card1-line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [100, 196, 40, 0]
    shapeName: straightConnector1
    border: {style: solid, width: 2, color: "$primary"}
  - elementId: card1-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [100, 210, 320, 30]
    content:
      fontSize: 20
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "Liter, alimamashuheiti"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>技术鸿沟</p>
  - elementId: card1-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [100, 252, 320, 340]
    content:
      fontSize: 16
      color: "$secondary"
      fontFamily: "Liter, MiSans"
      lineHeight: 1.6
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>增材工艺与传统制造体系存在系统性技术鸿沟</p>
        <p style="margin-top:8px">成形原理、性能控制、验收标准存在底层差异</p>
        <p style="margin-top:8px">尚无法实现对传统工艺的直接永久性替代</p>
        <p style="margin-top:8px">应用场景多集中在应急修复、临时替代等局部场景</p>
        <p style="margin-top:8px">工艺衔接标准缺失、全流程验证体系不足</p>
  - elementId: card2-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [460, 130, 360, 490]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$card"
  - elementId: card2-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [480, 150, 60, 40]
    content:
      fontSize: 28
      color: "$primary"
      fontFamily: "Liter"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>02</p>
  - elementId: card2-line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [480, 196, 40, 0]
    shapeName: straightConnector1
    border: {style: solid, width: 2, color: "$primary"}
  - elementId: card2-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [480, 210, 320, 30]
    content:
      fontSize: 20
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "Liter, alimamashuheiti"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>质量管控缺失</p>
  - elementId: card2-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [480, 252, 320, 340]
    content:
      fontSize: 16
      color: "$secondary"
      fontFamily: "Liter, MiSans"
      lineHeight: 1.6
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>行业质量一致性管控缺乏统一标准</p>
        <p style="margin-top:8px">全链路可信管控体系缺失</p>
        <p style="margin-top:8px">不同制造主体工艺标准参差不齐</p>
        <p style="margin-top:8px">跨厂交付质量波动大，责任边界难以界定</p>
        <p style="margin-top:8px">缺乏权威第三方质量验证机制</p>
  - elementId: card3-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [840, 130, 360, 490]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$card"
  - elementId: card3-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [860, 150, 60, 40]
    content:
      fontSize: 28
      color: "$primary"
      fontFamily: "Liter"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>03</p>
  - elementId: card3-line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [860, 196, 40, 0]
    shapeName: straightConnector1
    border: {style: solid, width: 2, color: "$primary"}
  - elementId: card3-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [860, 210, 320, 30]
    content:
      fontSize: 20
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "Liter, alimamashuheiti"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>重资产风险</p>
  - elementId: card3-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [860, 252, 320, 340]
    content:
      fontSize: 16
      color: "$secondary"
      fontFamily: "Liter, MiSans"
      lineHeight: 1.6
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>传统产能扩张沿用"批量购置设备、扩充人员"的重资产模式</p>
        <p style="margin-top:8px">资金占用高、运营刚性成本大</p>
        <p style="margin-top:8px">特种装备需求多品种、小批量、波动性强</p>
        <p style="margin-top:8px">单一企业重资产产能难以适配灵活需求</p>
        <p style="margin-top:8px">行业尚未形成去中心化分布式制造协同网络</p>
  - elementId: bottom-line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [80, 680, 1120, 0]
    shapeName: straightConnector1
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$border"}
  - elementId: page-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [1180, 690, 60, 20]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      align: [right, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>05</p>
